unbound variable: coral_function_that_does_not_exist

Assumption: a call to a name that is neither imported nor defined must be
rejected during checking as an unbound variable. This also pins the checker
behavior the bare-build triage probe relies on (see docs/UPSTREAM_BUGS.md
§Tracking, unbound `|>` pipe targets entry: large-concat admission of unbound
names is a known unnarrowed anomaly — a single unbound reference like this one
must always be rejected).
